#: ../../../LibFormat.md:1
msgid "LibFormat"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../LibFormat.md:3
msgid ""
"LibFormat is a library that implements automatic source code formatting "
"based on Clang. This document describes the LibFormat interface and design "
"as well as some basic style discussions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../LibFormat.md:7
msgid ""
"If you just want to use `clang-format` as a tool or integrated into an "
"editor, checkout {doc}`ClangFormat`."
msgstr ""

